Package: wmcoremap
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Enhances: wmaker
Description: per-core CPU heatmap dockapp for Window Maker
 wmcoremap shows every logical CPU as one LED in a grid inside a 64x64
 Window Maker dock tile. Each LED's colour follows the load of its CPU,
 from dark grey-green at idle through green to yellow and red near 100%. The
 grid scales from a few cores to a hundred or more.
 .
 The tile also shows total CPU use and the CPU temperature (Celsius or
 Fahrenheit), and left click cycles to load and temperature history
 graphs and, on amdgpu systems, GPU load.
